rom the excavation of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. They were hit by Sophie's [[Doublespell]] [[Raypulse]] and subsequently were knocked out by Dante. He later accompanied Klaus and [[unnamed Suit 026]] to the tomb.  Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a [[Raypulse]] and later invoked [[Enforcer]]. When Dante threw the [[Sceptre of Nefertiti]] into the pool, he and [[unnamed Suit 026]] were sent in to retrieve it. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}","text":"This Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nThis Suit later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt. Here, Sophie Casterwill led both him and unnamed Suit 025 away from the excavation of the Tomb of Nefertiti. They were hit by Sophie's Doublespell Raypulse and subsequently were knocked out by Dante. He later accompanied Klaus and unnamed Suit 026 to the tomb. Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a Raypulse and later invoked Enforcer. When Dante threw the Sceptre of Nefertiti into the pool, he and unnamed Suit 026 were sent in to retrieve it. [The Sceptre Deception]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• Enforcer\n• Redcap"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 027 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Vienna, Austria, under Klaus.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nThis Suit later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt. Here, Sophie Casterwill led both him and unnamed Suit 025 away from the excavation of the Tomb of Nefertiti. They were hit by Sophie's Doublespell Raypulse and subsequently were knocked out by Dante. He later accompanied Klaus and unnamed Suit 026 to the tomb. Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a Raypulse and later invoked Enforcer. When Dante threw the Sceptre of Nefertiti into the pool, he and unnamed Suit 026 were sent in to retrieve it. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Augerfrost\n\nBonded Titans\n\n• Enforcer\n• Redcap","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Unnamed Suit 027.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Vienna, Austria]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[Home Turf]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Blonde\n| eyes      = \n| va        = \n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 027''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from  [[Vienna, Austria]], under [[Klaus]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was sent by [[Klaus]], under the instructions of [[Rassimov]], to go after [[Dante Vale]] in [[County Kerry, Ireland]]. His team of Suits ambushed [[Scarlet Byrne]] and Dante's team in the [[New Grange Passage Tomb]] but were eventually defeated. {{source|Home Turf}}\n\nThis Suit later was sent to [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]]. Here, [[Sophie Casterwill]] led both him and [[unnamed Suit 025]] away from the excavation of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. They were hit by Sophie's [[Doublespell]] [[Raypulse]] and subsequently were knocked out by Dante. He later accompanied Klaus and [[unnamed Suit 026]] to the tomb.  Upon catching up to Dante's team at a pool, he attacked with a [[Raypulse]] and later invoked [[Enforcer]]. When Dante threw the [[Sceptre of Nefertiti]] into the pool, he and [[unnamed Suit 026]] were sent in to retrieve it. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:8234","status":"resolved","target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3228","status":"resolved","target_title":"Home Turf","label":"Home Turf","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Home_Turf","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3228"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8234","status":"resolved","target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_url